This is a react app in development for the Thera-Hand Device

Check you have node and npm, and install dependencies:

cadenroberts@Cadens-Air thera_app % node --version
v22.11.0
cadenroberts@Cadens-Air thera_app % npm --version
10.9.0
cadenroberts@Cadens-Air thera_app % npm install

Run "source .env" for good measure.

To start the app, run "docker compose up -d" and "npm run front" and "npm run back" and go to localhost:3000





